\n                \"min_pchembl_value must be less than max_pchembl_value\",\n            ),\n            (\n                self.molecular_weight_precision < 0,\n                \"molecular_weight_precision must be non-negative\",\n            ),\n        ]\n        for condition, message in validations:\n            if condition:\n                raise ValueError(message)"]}
